  "descriptionHtml": "<div data-page-id=\"CnWddxuoaoIkboxKEQ2cb1Afnpd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LkY9dzyxVoLxMtxI9cscH0H1nlg\">The <strong>Level 4 REC</strong> builds on Aventon’s legacy as a trusted, accessible commuter option, pairing a 750W hub motor with up to 75 miles of range for dependable, all-weather transportation. It’s built for riders who value simplicity, confidence, and everyday utility, offering strong acceleration for city streets, comfortable suspension for longer rides, and intuitive connectivity for security and peace of mind. With its combination of power, practicality, and affordability, the Level REC is the perfect balance of comfort and capability for riders who just want a bike that works every time they need it.</div>\n</div><h2>Buying your Aventon from Quest Watersports</h2><ul><li>Every e-bike purchased through Quest Watersports includes a <strong>$160 assembly and tuning fee</strong>.</li><li>Colors and sizes we don't have in stock can be special ordered. Call 815.433.2200 or request info below.</li><li>Financing is available through Synchrony, subject to credit approval.</li></ul>",
